cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use NaturalProductMech, please cite it.
title: >-
  NaturalProductMech: a knowledge base of individual natural product structures
  with producer organisms, gene clusters and mechanism
abstract: >-
  NaturalProductMech harmonizes MIBiG, ChEBI, LOTUS and PubChem into one
  evidence-backed, schema-validated YAML record per natural product chemical
  structure, carrying identity, structure, producer organisms with
  biosynthesis-grade evidence, cited occurrences, biosynthetic gene clusters,
  bioactivities and curated mechanism graphs.
authors:
  - name: NaturalProductMech Contributors
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: https://github.com/CultureBotAI/NaturalProductMech
type: dataset
keywords:
  - natural product
  - secondary metabolite
  - biosynthetic gene cluster
  - producer organism
  - biosynthesis
  - MIBiG
  - LOTUS
  - ChEBI
  - LinkML
  - knowledge graph
